"portfolio.estimated" = "Estimated from disclosed trades";
"portfolio.method" = "How holdings are estimated";
"portfolio.method.body" = "A validated House annual report supplies a year-end asset anchor; only later transactions adjust it. If no report validates, start empty at the first available trade. Purchases add the disclosed band midpoint; partial sales subtract it, with a zero floor. Explicit full sales close the position. Unspecified sales subtract the band and retain an uncertainty note. Ranges are propagated from band edges. Open-ended bands have no upper bound. Options, bonds and unmatched assets stay separate. Exchanges are logged without changing estimates. Spouse, joint and dependent accounts are included unless filtered. Dollar estimates are reconstructed disclosure amounts, not current market values. A sale before any purchase is marked as held before our records. These are incomplete, impersonal estimates, not actual holdings or a product to copy.";
